# Bane, Frozen King

> Bane is a side-lane pressure pick that turns skill casts into turret damage, then uses Sea Ink to stay on the map after trades other fighters would have to recall from. Pick him when your team can start fights without him and needs a lane that forces defenders away from Turtle, Lord, or mid pressure.

