Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-07. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Physical Pressure (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Endless Battle, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Endless Battle, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when crowd control is light enough to skip Fortitude.; Sea Halberd over Blade of the Heptaseas when Use when healing, shielding, or high-extra-HP fighters are surviving the first cannon and Shark Bite cycle.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use when ahead and one more damage slot will end side-lane towers before the enemy can group.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against mixed burst or magic pickoff attempts that hit before Sea Ink can recover the trade.
- Total cost: 11170 gold

Default EXP setup for side-lane turret pressure, cannon bounce poke, and short trades built around Endless Battle plus Shark Bite.

### Jungle Objective Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Endless Battle, Hunter Strike, War Axe, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Endless Battle, Hunter Strike, War Axe
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy lacks reliable control and faster skill cycling matters more than Fortitude.; Queen's Wings over Malefic Roar when Use when objective fights are extended and survival at low HP matters more than armor penetration.; Sea Halberd over War Axe when Use when the enemy frontline relies on healing or shields during Turtle and Lord fights.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use when your team is ahead and Bane can convert every pick into Lord or inhibitor pressure.
- Total cost: 11320 gold

Jungle setup for Turtle tempo, Ice Retribution chase control, and objective fights where Bane plays as a damage bruiser.

### Magic Sustain Flex (EXP)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Concentrated Energy, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings, Winter Crown
- Core: Concentrated Energy, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Ice Queen Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your team needs extra chase and layered slows more than a larger magic shield.; Athena's Shield over Winter Crown when Use when burst magic removes Bane before he can charge Sea Ink or cast Deadly Catch.; Radiant Armor over Winter Crown when Use against repeated magic damage that stacks through long river fights.; Immortality over Winter Crown when Use for final sieges when a resurrection is more useful than a one-time stasis active.
- Total cost: 11690 gold

Magic flex setup for drafts that already have physical turret damage and need Bane to punish armor stacking with Sea Ink and Deadly Catch.

